WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.162
Install RIVL without an App Store release. This
illustrated guide uses SideStore

2
00:00:04.162 --> 00:00:08.324
and your own free Apple account. You need a
computer for setup,

3
00:00:08.324 --> 00:00:11.792
and you must refresh the apps before seven days
expire.

4
00:00:12.792 --> 00:00:17.458
Have your iPhone, a USB cable, a computer, Wi-
Fi, and your Apple

5
00:00:17.458 --> 00:00:22.125
account ready. If you already use RIVL, export
your workouts first. Keep

6
00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:25.625
your existing app until you have verified the
transfer.

7
00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:31.211
Open the official SideStore documentation at
docs dot sidestore dot io. Follow

8
00:00:31.211 --> 00:00:35.796
its current prerequisites to get iLoader for
your computer and LocalDevVPN for

9
00:00:35.796 --> 00:00:40.000
your phone. The VPN helper may require an App
Store download.

10
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.726
Connect and unlock your iPhone. Trust the
computer when asked. In iLoader,

11
00:00:45.726 --> 00:00:50.452
choose Install SideStore, Stable, and complete
the Apple account steps yourself. Follow

12
00:00:50.452 --> 00:00:53.208
the official guide if any screen differs.

13
00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:58.679
On your phone, follow the official guide to
trust the developer app

14
00:00:58.679 --> 00:01:03.150
and enable Developer Mode if required. Restart
if prompted. Connect LocalDevVPN, then

15
00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:06.875
open SideStore and sign in with the same Apple
account.

16
00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:13.261
While connected to Wi-Fi and LocalDevVPN, open
My Apps in SideStore and

17
00:01:13.261 --> 00:01:17.750
refresh SideStore once. Complete this initial
refresh before installing RIVL.

18
00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:23.066
Open the GitHub release linked below this video
and save RIVL dot

19
00:01:23.066 --> 00:01:27.382
IPA to Files on your iPhone. In SideStore, open
My Apps, tap

20
00:01:27.382 --> 00:01:31.697
the plus button, and select that file. Let
SideStore finish signing and

21
00:01:31.697 --> 00:01:32.417
installing it.

22
00:01:33.417 --> 00:01:37.835
Open RIVL and sign in. Choose the permissions
you need. This download

23
00:01:37.835 --> 00:01:42.254
contains the iPhone app only. After re-signing,
check Health access and a

24
00:01:42.254 --> 00:01:46.672
short GPS recording before relying on it for a
workout. These capabilities

25
00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:49.250
still need validation on your signed
installation.

26
00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:55.450
Refresh both RIVL and SideStore before their
seven day counters expire. Use

27
00:01:55.450 --> 00:02:00.650
Wi-Fi and LocalDevVPN. Background refresh can
fail, so check the countdown. Free

28
00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:05.850
accounts allow three apps including SideStore.
Pairing problems or iOS updates may

29
00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:07.583
require your computer again.

30
00:02:08.583 --> 00:02:13.273
The release, written guide, and official
SideStore links are at github dot

31
00:02:13.273 --> 00:02:17.962
com slash OjayitTanwar slash rivl. If
installation fails, use the troubleshooting
steps

32
00:02:17.962 --> 00:02:22.651
in the guide. Keep your current RIVL data backed
up while changing

33
00:02:22.651 --> 00:02:23.042
installers.
